  "claim": "A retired Alaskan ice hockey goaltender was part of the 1980 U.S. hockey team that won the gold medal at the Olympic games that were held in Lake Placid. The actor who is best known for portraying this goaltender also stars in Glory Days a 2002 TV series.",
